flowchart TB
  input[common + one host delta] --> render[render / normalizeDelta]
  render --> mode{write or check}
  mode -->|check| compare[compare each generated output]
  compare -->|drift| drift[exit 1: list drift]
  compare -->|equal| genok[generation check complete]
  mode -->|write| temp[write PID temp file]
  temp --> rename[rename one output]
  rename --> next[repeat for five outputs]
  temp -->|I/O failure| renderfail[exit 2: prior outputs may remain]
  rename -->|I/O failure| renderfail
  next --> genok
  setup[host setup or explicit install] --> args[parse profile]
  args -->|invalid| argfail[exit 2: no install started]
  args --> retire[remove only matched retired symlinks]
  retire --> each[iterate host assets and bin]
  each --> dest{real destination exists?}
  dest -->|yes| skip[SKIP: preserve existing file]
  dest -->|no / symlink| link[ln -sfn to repository source]
  skip --> installed[install exit 0 after loop]
  link --> installed
  link -->|command failure| partial[nonzero: earlier links remain]
  installed -->|caller invokes separately| verify[verify-install]
  verify --> links[expected links / permissions / retired entries]
  links --> configs[routing and hook config checks]
  configs --> probe[isolated Cursor hook probe]
  probe --> aggregate{failure flag}
  aggregate -->|0| ok[exit 0: placement and checks complete]
  aggregate -->|1| fail[exit 1: diagnostics to caller]
  probe -.->|forced termination| unknown[temporary directory cleanup not guaranteed]
  ok -.-> session[host session discovery is separate]
  fail -.-> preserve[existing config and links retained]
